            <trans-unit id="tab.highlight" approved="yes"><source>Highlight</source><target>Áhersla</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.title" approved="yes"><source>Title</source><target>Heiti</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.description" approved="yes"><source>Introductory note</source><target>Inngangstexti</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.description.hint" approved="yes"><source>Shown above the prices in every layout, e.g. “All prices per month, plus VAT.”</source><target>Sýnt fyrir ofan verðin í öllu útlitinu, t.d. „Öll verð á mánuði, að viðbættum VSK.“</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.taxMode" approved="yes"><source>Entered amounts are</source><target>Skráðar upphæðir eru</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.taxMode.hint" approved="yes"><source>Defines how the entered amounts are read. Conversion only runs from net to gross, never the other way round.</source><target>Skilgreinir hvernig skráðar upphæðir eru lesnar. Umreikningur fer aðeins úr nettó yfir í brúttó, aldrei öfugt.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.taxMode.net" approved="yes"><source>Net prices</source><target>Nettóverð</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.taxMode.gross" approved="yes"><source>Gross prices</source><target>Brúttóverð</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.taxRate" approved="yes"><source>Tax rate in percent</source><target>Skattprósenta</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.taxRate.hint" approved="yes"><source>Basis for the gross display. 0 skips the conversion.</source><target>Grunnur fyrir brúttóverð. 0 sleppir umreikningi.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.taxSwitchable" approved="yes"><source>Visitors may switch between net and gross</source><target>Gestir geta skipt á milli nettó og brúttó</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.taxSwitchable.hint" approved="yes"><source>Unchecked, the page only shows the option selected above.</source><target>Ef ekki er hakað við, sýnir síðan aðeins þann valkost sem valinn er að ofan.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.currencySwitchable" approved="yes"><source>Currency switchable</source><target>Gjaldmiðill skiptanlegur</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.currencySwitchable.hint" approved="yes"><source>The switch only appears if more than one currency is entered for the plans.</source><target>Skiptingin birtist aðeins ef fleiri en einn gjaldmiðill hefur verið skráður á pökkunum.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.periodSwitchable" approved="yes"><source>Billing period switchable</source><target>Greiðslutímabil skiptanlegt</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.periodSwitchable.hint" approved="yes"><source>The switch only appears if more than one period is entered for the plans.</source><target>Skiptingin birtist aðeins ef fleiri en eitt tímabil hefur verið skráð á pökkunum.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.currencyPosition" approved="yes"><source>Currency symbol</source><target>Gjaldmiðilstákn</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.currencyPosition.hint" approved="yes"><source>English usually puts it before the amount (“€ 99”), German and most continental European languages after it (“99 €”).</source><target>Enska setur það venjulega fyrir framan upphæðina („€ 99“), þýska og flest evrópsk meginlandsmál setja það á eftir henni („99 €“).</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.currencyPosition.before" approved="yes"><source>before the amount (€ 99)</source><target>fyrir framan upphæðina (€ 99)</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.currencyPosition.after" approved="yes"><source>after the amount (99 €)</source><target>á eftir upphæðinni (99 €)</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.selectLabel" approved="yes"><source>Button label</source><target>Hnappatexti</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.selectLabel.hint" approved="yes"><source>Applies to all plans without a label of their own. Empty means “Select”.</source><target>Á við alla pakka án eigin merkis. Tómt þýðir „Velja“.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.selectLabel.placeholder" approved="yes"><source>Select</source><target>Velja</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.plans" approved="yes"><source>Plans</source><target>Pakkar</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.groups" approved="yes"><source>Feature groups</source><target>Eiginleikahópar</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.groups.hint" approved="yes"><source>Features belong to the table, not to a single plan — that is the only way the comparison table compares like with like.</source><target>Eiginleikar tilheyra töflunni, ekki einum pakka — það er eina leiðin til að samanburðartaflan beri saman sambærilegt.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.title" approved="yes"><source>Name</source><target>Heiti</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.subtitle" approved="yes"><source>Subtitle</source><target>Undirtitill</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.subtitle.hint" approved="yes"><source>One line below the name, e.g. “6 job ads for 30 days each”.</source><target>Ein lína fyrir neðan heitið, t.d. „6 atvinnuauglýsingar í 30 daga hver“.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.eyebrow" approved="yes"><source>Eyebrow</source><target>Yfirlína</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.eyebrow.hint" approved="yes"><source>Small line above the name, e.g. “48 resources included”.</source><target>Lítil lína fyrir ofan heitið, t.d. „48 auðlindir innifaldar“.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.description" approved="yes"><source>Description</source><target>Lýsing</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.favourite" approved="yes"><source>Highlight</source><target>Áhersla</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.favourite.hint" approved="yes"><source>The plan gets a border and shadow in the accent colour, and a tinted column in the comparison table.</source><target>Pakkinn fær ramma og skugga í áherslulit, og litaðan dálk í samanburðartöflunni.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.badge" approved="yes"><source>Badge text</source><target>Texti merkis</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.badge.hint" approved="yes"><source>Empty omits the badge. Common are “Popular” or “Recommended”.</source><target>Tómt sleppir merkinu. Algeng eru „Vinsælt“ eða „Mælt með“.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.badge.placeholder" approved="yes"><source>Popular</source><target>Vinsæll</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.selectLink" approved="yes"><source>Select button target</source><target>Tengill valhnapps</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.selectLink.hint" approved="yes"><source>Without a link no button is rendered — neither an empty one nor a placeholder.</source><target>Án tengils er enginn hnappur birtur — hvorki tómur né staðgengill.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.selectLabel" approved="yes"><source>Own label</source><target>Eiginn hnappatexti</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.selectLabel.hint" approved="yes"><source>Overrides the label from the pricing table, for this plan only.</source><target>Hnekkir hnappatextanum frá verðtöflunni, aðeins fyrir þennan pakka.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.priceNote" approved="yes"><source>Note below the price</source><target>Athugasemd fyrir neðan verð</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.priceNote.hint" approved="yes"><source>E.g. “billed annually” or “excl. VAT”.</source><target>T.d. „greiðist árlega“ eða „án VSK“.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.prices" approved="yes"><source>Prices</source><target>Verð</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.attributeValues" approved="yes"><source>Feature values</source><target>Eiginleikagildi</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.attributeValues.hint" approved="yes"><source>Features without a value count as not included and show a dash. Not every cell has to be filled.</source><target>Eiginleikar án gildis teljast ekki innifaldir og sýna bandstrik. Ekki þarf að fylla út í hvern reit.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="price.currency" approved="yes"><source>Currency</source><target>Gjaldmiðill</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="price.period" approved="yes"><source>Period</source><target>Tímabil</target></trans-unit>
